              "json": "## Azure service retirements\r\n\r\nThis tab shows two independent retirement sources in separate grids. The rows are not\r\njoined or merged:\r\n\r\n* **Service Health retirements** are advisories retained for the selected\r\n  subscriptions. They include both upcoming deadlines and past-due retirements that\r\n  might still require customer action, with tracking ID, status, summary, and date.\r\n* **Advisor retirements** are the Microsoft-published metadata catalog for AI, Data,\r\n  Network, and Infrastructure services since 2024, including both elapsed and future\r\n  dates. The **# Resources** column counts matching Advisor recommendations in the\r\n  selected subscription/resource-group scope. Select a row to inspect those resources\r\n  in the grid below.\r\n\r\nService Health and Advisor remain separate sources. The Advisor count and resource\r\ndetails are derived only from `advisorresources` recommendation records.",
